 "   \"capabilities\": \"read per request from _meta io.modelcontextprotocol/clientCapabilities: elicitation decides the confirm, the MCP Apps extension the card\",",
 "   \"headers\": \"MCP-Protocol-Version and Mcp-Method are required and must equal the body's version and method; Mcp-Name, when sent, must equal params.name (params.uri for resources/read), its =?base64?…?= form decoded; an Mcp-Session-Id is ignored and none is sent\",",
 "   \"errors\": {",
