 "  \"reads\": \"at most five D1 statements beyond the memoized auth, in ONE parallel wave (src/hotsql.js), then the checklist's meter once the open questions are read (src/checklist.js checklistFor: CHECKLIST_SQL, one statement; the questions and the owed set are this request's): S1 HOME_TX_AGG_SQL (the metrics), S2 HOME_OWNER_ROWS_SQL for the owner (the newest four approve and grant rows with their counter counts, on migrate-038's idx_transmission_parent) or HOME_FIRST5_SQL for anyone else, S3 DECISIONS_LIVE_SQL (via readDecisions), S4 HOME_GOALS_MOVED_SQL, S5 HOME_SEATS_SQL; the org's row (src/tenant.js, once a minute per isolate)\",",
