 "  \"project\": \"the request's workspace, else the org's one declared project, else none (the rows no project stamps); the page shows the project's NAME, never its key\",",
 "  \"empty\": \"every region draws its own EMPTY sentence: aim 'No measure published for this aim yet.' (no aim.measure) or 'No aim is published for this project yet.'; needs-you (a seat with no filing yet: the first-five steps are its next action; never the owner's); goals-moved 'No goal moved this month.'; who-is-here 'Nobody is seated on this project yet.'; the Shipped card until the brain exports it\",",
 "  \"live\": \"a failed D1 statement (not the daily quota, which answers the outage page) -> live:'unreachable': the regions it fed read null/EMPTY and the page shows UNREACHABLE (writes refused before the press)\",",
 "  \"buttons\": \"decide row: choose-option -> POST /respond {qid, option:0, next:/home}; see-options -> GET /question/:qid · approve row: approve -> POST /contribution/:id/decide {verdict:approve, next:/home}; see-diff -> GET /contribution/:id · grant row: grant-once -> the same door {verdict:approve, note:'granted once'}; not-yet -> {verdict:needs-work, note:'not yet'}, terminal (no snooze: the agent re-files with parent) · counters: client-side, the count from this read and the exact MCP call (by gapRefs q/<qid> on a decide row, by parent on an approve or grant row) · all-open -> /decisions\",",
