 " \"broadcast\": {",
 "  \"_doc\": \"additive (UI-B11a, Broadcast: the read and the two person verbs; the screen is UI-B11b). Owner rulings: Q2485A7FD (Broadcast is its own tab; publish a skill, an agent or a workflow; any user equips; updates push), Q0E5A1073 (anyone publishes freely; publishing is an OFFER; every control sits on equip), Q571B3D89 (equip per project, attributed, visible), QEBB5D318 (an equip is pinned to its version; an update shows a notice, the holder chooses), QF4501CEC (Broadcast stops at the org wall), Q60CCC574 (a human verb has NO tool at the MCP door; superseded by MCP.md §5, sprint 3 D2: publish and equip are tools, previewed first), Q93B3F368 (project, not workspace); owner MCQ 2026-09-29 Fork 1 (a) item, publish and equip are FILINGS on the existing ledger (no table, no migration), Fork 2 (a) anyone seated publishes their OWN filed item, equip and update by anyone seated on that project, both a signed-in-browser press only. Sprint 2 (the owner's MCQs of 2026-09-30 evening and 2026-10-01): the STARTER shelf built into the engine (src/presets/*.md, bundled by tools/make-presets.mjs into src/presetdata.js, src/starter.js: six agents, three workflows, three skills, the same for every org, versioned with the engine; Equip copies one into a project), the live picture (the last week's landed contributions as dots flowing from people to the goals they name, GET /broadcast/live), and a Partner never equips.\",",
