 " \"projectScope\": {",
 "  \"_doc\": \"additive (U-MCP, batch:mcp-project-scope; owner ruling Q0D506BBC, Forks 1-4, 2026-09-29; Q93B3F368 project, not workspace; ADR-100; M-ADR-027): every project-scoped read at every door reads the project the caller NAMES, checked against their seats, per call — generic for every org, no per-project branch (a project differs only by its data), no use_project tool, no migration, no write. ONE helper, src/project.js resolveProject(person, want, seats, env), is called by the workspace seam (src/index.js routeRequest: the GET twins' ?project=), src/mcp.js callTool (every MCP_TOOLS row flagged project:true — tools[].project in door.json, derived) and src/mcp.js resources/read (?project= on a brain:// URI). The seats are read once per request (src/core.js seatsOnce, D9).\",",
