 " \"formats\": {",
 "  \"_doc\": \"GENERATED from the registries (src/knowledge/schema.js KINDS, src/shapes.js SHAPES) by src/formats.js: the `formats` tool and GET /formats answer the same. list: every kind and shape in a line; kinds.<kind>: its fields, rules, example, where it shows, its checklist items; shapes.<lane>: a contribution's fields, example and places.\",",
 "  \"list\": {",
 "   \"kinds\": [",
 "    {",
 "     \"kind\": \"aim\",",
 "     \"line\": \"what the project is for, and the number that says it is working (one per project)\",",
 "     \"tabs\": [",
 "      \"home\"",
 "     ]",
 "    },",
 "    {",
 "     \"kind\": \"goal\",",
 "     \"line\": \"one goal of the project's goal tree: one root, every other goal under a parent\",",
 "     \"tabs\": [",
 "      \"goals\"",
 "     ]",
 "    },",
 "    {",
 "     \"kind\": \"question\",",
 "     \"line\": \"a question the project must decide, with its options; the owner rules it. A ruling already made is a decided question: its options and its choice, or the ruled option alone\",",
 "     \"tabs\": [",
 "      \"decisions\"",
 "     ]",
 "    },",
 "    {",
 "     \"kind\": \"check\",",
 "     \"line\": \"what done looks like (given, when, then), naming the nodes, goals or questions it grades; a grade (submit_grade {checkId, verdict, proof}, filed at once) grades it\",",
 "     \"tabs\": [",
 "      \"map\",",
 "      \"goals\"",
 "     ]",
 "    },",
 "    {",
 "     \"kind\": \"card\",",
 "     \"line\": \"any other piece of knowledge (a claim, a target, a decision record, a plan item), sorted by its card kind\",",
 "     \"tabs\": [",
 "      \"map\"",
 "     ]",
 "    },",
 "    {",
 "     \"kind\": \"card_kind\",",
 "     \"line\": \"a kind of card the project uses (claims, targets, copy, decisions), with its label and the tab its cards list on\",",
 "     \"tabs\": [",
 "      \"map\"",
 "     ]",
 "    },",
 "    {",
 "     \"kind\": \"node\",",
 "     \"line\": \"one piece of the project's model: surface, lane, screen, door, table, entity, flow, gap, dep, evidence, service, architecture (data holds what its type carries)\",",
 "     \"tabs\": [",
 "      \"map\"",
 "     ]",
 "    },",
 "    {",
 "     \"kind\": \"edge\",",
 "     \"line\": \"a link between two nodes of the model: nav, reads, writes, relation, depends, blocks, flow-step\",",
 "     \"tabs\": [",
 "      \"map\"",
 "     ]",
 "    },",
 "    {",
 "     \"kind\": \"gtm\",",
 "     \"line\": \"the go-to-market template: the kinds of GTM activity, what each holds, and what proves it (one per project)\",",
 "     \"tabs\": [",
 "      \"gtm\"",
 "     ]",
 "    },",
 "    {",
 "     \"kind\": \"doc\",",
 "     \"line\": \"a markdown doc of the project, by its path: start-here.md is what a newcomer reads first, the GTM strategy goes under gtm/\",",
 "     \"tabs\": [",
 "      \"home\",",
 "      \"gtm\"",
 "     ]",
 "    },",
 "    {",
 "     \"kind\": \"render\",",
 "     \"line\": \"one frame of a screen node, keyed (screen, state, variant): html, a picture (png, jpeg or webp, as base64), or a wireframe\",",
 "     \"tabs\": [",
 "      \"map\"",
 "     ]",
 "    },",
 "    {",
